# Kenney models stay local: GitHub refuses Git LFS objects on a public fork, so the owner chose
# not to commit them (answer 8, research/noirgfx/owner-answers.md). `noirgfx curate <zips>`
# extracts the bundles into kenney/, copies the used packs into kenney-curated/ and verifies them
# against kenney-curated.sha256, which is committed.
kenney/
kenney-curated/
